  <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about custom signage manufacturing, pricing, and installation in Patna.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion">
        <!-- Q1 -->
        <div class="faq-item active">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>What types of signage do you manufacture?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We manufacture 3D LED channel letters, acrylic glow signs, stainless steel (SS 304) titanium finish letters, ACP facade panels, storefront branding boards, pylon/totem monuments, flex boards, and neon signage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you provide LED and 3D signage?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, LED and 3D signage are our core specialties. We fabricate front-lit, back-lit (halo effect), and edge-lit 3D letters using IP67 waterproof LED diodes with uniform light distribution.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you manufacture signage in-house?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, 100% of our production takes place inside our own workshop in Patna. We own computerized CNC routers, laser cutters, channel letter bending machines, and wide-format printers so you never pay third-party middleman margins.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q4 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you provide signage installation?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes. Our in-house installation team handles site measurement, structural scaffolding, civil mounting anchors, and safe electrical connections across Patna and throughout Bihar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q5 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>How much does shop signage cost in Patna?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Signage cost depends on dimensions, material selection (ACP, acrylic, stainless steel), and lighting type (frontlit vs halo backlit). We offer free site inspections and transparent itemized estimates with zero hidden costs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q6 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you provide ACP signage?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, we specialize in complete ACP (Aluminium Composite Panel) cladding for shop fronts, corporate showrooms, and building facades with router-cut backlit letters.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q7 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you also provide flex printing?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, our facility includes high-speed wide-format printers for star flex, frontlit & backlit flex banners, and adhesive vinyl graphics to provide end-to-end branding under one roof.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q8 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>How long does signage production take?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Standard LED channel letter and ACP boards typically take 4 to 7 working days from final artwork approval. Urgent express fabrication is also available on request.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q9 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you provide custom signage designs?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, our dedicated graphic design team provides realistic 3D day/night visualizations so you can see exactly how the signage will look on your building before production begins.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q10 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Which areas in Patna do you serve?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon-toggle">+</div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We serve all areas across Patna including Boring Road, Fraser Road, Kankarbagh, Bailey Road, Exhibition Road, Patliputra, Danapur, Raja Bazar, Saguna More, Ashiana Nagar, and adjacent districts throughout Bihar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

